Source: shockos-gnome-layouts
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Carson Grover
Homepage: https://www.shockos.net
Package: shockos-gnome-layouts
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Depends: shockos-deskenv-gnome (>= 10), python3, gnome-shell-extension-arc-menu, gnome-shell-extension-dashtodock, gnome-shell-extension-dash-to-panel, gnome-shell-extension-desktop-icons-ng
Description: Change the desktop layout of Shock OS GNOME Edition
    Available layouts include:
     - Dock mode: Uses dash-to-dock to provide an autohiding dock.
     - Panel mode: Uses dash-to-panel to provide an always-visible taskbar with a menu and window list.
     - Vanilla mode: The default GNOME workflow, no panel or persistent dock.
